# CUDASolver - cuSOLVER线性代数接口封装

来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/linalg/CUDASolver.cpp, CUDASolver.h

---

## getrf (LU分解)

【签名】
```
getrf<T>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    m: int, n: int,
    dA: T*,           # 输入/输出矩阵，device指针
    ldda: int,        # 列主序leading dimension
    ipiv: int*,       # 输出pivot索引，device指针
    info: int*        # 输出状态码，device指针
) where T in {float, double, complex<float>, complex<double>}
```

【算法】
```
# Step 1: 查询工作空间大小
lwork = cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}getrf_bufferSize(handle, m, n, dA, ldda)

# Step 2: 分配工作空间
workspace = CUDACachingAllocator::allocate(sizeof(T) * lwork)

# Step 3: 执行LU分解
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}getrf(
    handle, m, n, 
    dA, ldda,           # in-place更新为L和U
    workspace, 
    ipiv,               # 输出行交换索引
    info                # 0成功，<0参数错误，>0奇异矩阵
)
```

【依赖】
- cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}getrf: cuSOLVER的LU分解
- TORCH_CUSOLVER_CHECK: 错误检查宏
- c10::cuda::CUDACachingAllocator: 临时内存分配

---

## getrs (用LU分解求解线性方程组)

【签名】
```
getrs<T>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    n: int, nrhs: int,
    dA: T*,           # LU分解结果（来自getrf）
    lda: int,
    ipiv: int*,       # pivot索引（来自getrf）
    ret: T*,          # 输入右端项B，输出解X
    ldb: int,
    info: int*,
    trans: cublasOperation_t = CUBLAS_OP_N
) where T in {float, double, complex<float>, complex<double>}
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}getrs(
    handle, trans, n, nrhs,
    dA, lda,           # LU分解矩阵
    ipiv,              # pivot索引
    ret, ldb,          # in-place求解 A*X = B
    info
)
```

【备注】
- 无需额外工作空间
- trans指定是否转置/共轭转置求解

---

## sytrf (对称/Hermitian矩阵的Bunch-Kaufman分解)

【签名】
```
sytrf_bufferSize<T>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    n: int,
    A: T*,
    lda: int,
    lwork: int*       # 输出工作空间大小
) where T in {float, double, complex<float>, complex<double>}

sytrf<T>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    uplo: cublasFillMode_t,    # CUBLAS_FILL_MODE_UPPER/LOWER
    n: int,
    A: T*,
    lda: int,
    ipiv: int*,
    work: T*,
    lwork: int,
    devInfo: int*
)
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}sytrf(
    handle, uplo, n,
    A, lda,            # in-place输出分解结果
    ipiv,              # 输出pivot索引
    work, lwork,
    devInfo
)
```

---

## gesvd (奇异值分解 - 标准算法)

【签名】
```
gesvd_buffersize<T>(handle, m, n, lwork) 
    where T in {float, double, complex<float>, complex<double>}

gesvd<T, Vtype>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    jobu: signed char,     # 'A'全U, 'S'瘦U, 'N'不计算
    jobvt: signed char,    # 'A'全VT, 'S'瘦VT, 'N'不计算
    m: int, n: int,
    A: T*,                 # 输入矩阵
    lda: int,
    S: Vtype*,             # 输出奇异值（实数）
    U: T*,
    ldu: int,
    VT: T*,
    ldvt: int,
    work: T*,
    lwork: int,
    rwork: Vtype*,         # 复数类型需要实数工作空间
    info: int*
) where (T, Vtype) in {(float, float), (double, double), 
                       (complex<float>, float), (complex<double>, double)}
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}gesvd(
    handle, jobu, jobvt, m, n,
    A, lda,
    S,                 # 输出 min(m,n) 个奇异值
    U, ldu,            # 左奇异向量
    VT, ldvt,          # 右奇异向量（转置）
    work, lwork,
    rwork,             # 仅复数类型使用
    info
)
```

---

## gesvdj (奇异值分解 - Jacobi迭代算法)

【签名】
```
gesvdj_buffersize<T, Vtype>(
    handle, jobz, econ, m, n, A, lda, S, U, ldu, V, ldv, lwork, params
)

gesvdj<T, Vtype>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    jobz: cusolverEigMode_t,   # CUSOLVER_EIG_MODE_VECTOR/NOVECTOR
    econ: int,                  # 0=全矩阵, 1=经济型
    m: int, n: int,
    A: T*,
    lda: int,
    S: Vtype*,
    U: T*,
    ldu: int,
    V: T*,                      # 注意：V不是VT
    ldv: int,
    work: T*,
    lwork: int,
    info: int*,
    params: gesvdjInfo_t        # Jacobi参数（容差、最大迭代等）
)
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}gesvdj(
    handle, jobz, econ, m, n,
    A, lda,
    S,
    U, ldu,
    V, ldv,            # 右奇异向量（非转置）
    work, lwork,
    info,
    params
)
```

【备注】
- 相比gesvd，Jacobi算法对小矩阵更快
- params可设置容差和最大迭代次数

---

## gesvdjBatched (批量SVD - Jacobi算法)

【签名】
```
gesvdjBatched<T, Vtype>(
    handle, jobz, m, n,
    A: T*,             # batch矩阵，连续存储
    lda: int,
    S: Vtype*,         # batch奇异值
    U: T*,
    ldu: int,
    V: T*,
    ldv: int,
    info: int*,        # batch状态码
    params: gesvdjInfo_t,
    batchSize: int
)
```

【算法】
```
# Step 1: 查询工作空间
lwork = cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}gesvdjBatched_bufferSize(
    handle, jobz, m, n, A, lda, S, U, ldu, V, ldv, params, batchSize
)

# Step 2: 分配工作空间
workspace = CUDACachingAllocator::allocate(sizeof(T) * lwork)

# Step 3: 批量SVD
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}gesvdjBatched(
    handle, jobz, m, n,
    A, lda,            # 输入 batchSize 个 m×n 矩阵
    S,                 # 输出 batchSize 组奇异值
    U, ldu,
    V, ldv,
    workspace, lwork,
    info,              # batchSize 个状态码
    params, batchSize
)
```

---

## gesvdaStridedBatched (批量SVD - Approximate算法，仅CUDA)

【签名】
```
gesvdaStridedBatched_buffersize<T, Vtype>(
    handle, jobz, rank, m, n,
    A: T*, lda: int, strideA: long long,
    S: Vtype*, strideS: long long,
    U: T*, ldu: int, strideU: long long,
    V: T*, ldv: int, strideV: long long,
    lwork: int*,
    batchSize: int
)

gesvdaStridedBatched<T, Vtype>(
    handle, jobz, rank, m, n,
    A: T*, lda: int, strideA: long long,
    S: Vtype*, strideS: long long,
    U: T*, ldu: int, strideU: long long,
    V: T*, ldv: int, strideV: long long,
    work: T*,
    lwork: int,
    info: int*,
    h_R_nrmF: double*,  # 输出每个矩阵的Frobenius范数残差（host指针）
    batchSize: int
)
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}gesvdaStridedBatched(
    handle, jobz, rank, m, n,
    A, lda, strideA,   # strided batch输入
    S, strideS,        # 输出前rank个奇异值
    U, ldu, strideU,   # 输出前rank列
    V, ldv, strideV,   # 输出前rank行
    work, lwork,
    info,
    h_R_nrmF,          # 输出近似误差
    batchSize
)
```

【备注】
- rank: 指定保留的奇异值数量（低秩近似）
- h_R_nrmF: host端数组，存储每个矩阵的残差范数
- 仅CUDA支持（ROCm无此API）

