## potrf (Cholesky分解)

【签名】
```
potrf_buffersize<T>(handle, uplo, n, A, lda, lwork)

potrf<T>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    uplo: cublasFillMode_t,    # UPPER/LOWER
    n: int,
    A: T*,                     # 输入正定矩阵，输出三角因子
    lda: int,
    work: T*,
    lwork: int,
    info: int*
) where T in {float, double, complex<float>, complex<double>}
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}potrf(
    handle, uplo, n,
    A, lda,            # in-place输出L或U
    work, lwork,
    info               # 0成功，>0矩阵非正定
)
```

---

## potrfBatched (批量Cholesky分解)

【签名】
```
potrfBatched<T>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    uplo: cublasFillMode_t,
    n: int,
    A: T**,            # batch矩阵指针数组
    lda: int,
    info: int*,
    batchSize: int
)
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}potrfBatched(
    handle, uplo, n,
    A, lda,            # batchSize 个矩阵指针
    info,              # batchSize 个状态码
    batchSize
)
```

【备注】
- 无需工作空间
- A是指针数组（非strided batch）

---

## xpotrf (64位索引Cholesky分解，仅cuSOLVER >= 11000)

【签名】
```
xpotrf_buffersize(
    handle, params, uplo, n,
    dataTypeA: cudaDataType,
    A: void*,
    lda: int64_t,
    computeType: cudaDataType,
    workspaceInBytesOnDevice: size_t*,
    workspaceInBytesOnHost: size_t*
)

xpotrf(
    handle, params, uplo, n,
    dataTypeA: cudaDataType,
    A: void*,
    lda: int64_t,
    computeType: cudaDataType,
    bufferOnDevice: void*,
    workspaceInBytesOnDevice: size_t,
    bufferOnHost: void*,
    workspaceInBytesOnHost: size_t,
    info: int*
)
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDnXpotrf(
    handle, params, uplo, n,
    dataTypeA, A, lda,
    computeType,
    bufferOnDevice, workspaceInBytesOnDevice,
    bufferOnHost, workspaceInBytesOnHost,
    info
)
```

【备注】
- 支持int64_t索引（大矩阵）
- 需要device和host两侧工作空间
- cudaDataType映射：CUDA_R_32F, CUDA_R_64F, CUDA_C_32F, CUDA_C_64F

