## geqrf (QR分解)

【签名】
```
geqrf_bufferSize<T>(handle, m, n, A, lda, lwork)

geqrf<T>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    m: int, n: int,
    A: T*,             # 输入矩阵，输出R（上三角）和Householder向量
    lda: int,
    tau: T*,           # 输出Householder系数
    work: T*,
    lwork: int,
    devInfo: int*
)
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}geqrf(
    handle, m, n,
    A, lda,            # in-place输出R和隐式Q
    tau,               # 输出 min(m,n) 个系数
    work, lwork,
    devInfo
)
```

