## potrs (用Cholesky分解求解方程组)

【签名】
```
potrs<T>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    uplo: cublasFillMode_t,
    n: int, nrhs: int,
    A: const T*,       # Cholesky因子（来自potrf）
    lda: int,
    B: T*,             # 输入右端项，输出解
    ldb: int,
    devInfo: int*
)
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}potrs(
    handle, uplo, n, nrhs,
    A, lda,            # 三角因子
    B, ldb,            # in-place求解 A*X = B
    devInfo
)
```

