## orgqr (从QR分解生成正交矩阵Q)

【签名】
```
orgqr_buffersize<T>(handle, m, n, k, A, lda, tau, lwork)

orgqr<T>(
    handle: cusolverDnHandle_t,
    m: int, n: int, k: int,
    A: T*,             # 输入Householder向量，输出Q
    lda: int,
    tau: const T*,     # Householder系数（来自geqrf）
    work: T*,
    lwork: int,
    devInfo: int*
)
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}orgqr(  # 复数类型用ungqr
    handle, m, n, k,
    A, lda,            # in-place生成前n列Q
    tau,
    work, lwork,
    devInfo
)
```

【备注】
- k: Householder反射的数量（通常 k = min(m,n)）
- 复数类型调用ungqr（unitary而非orthogonal）

---

## ormqr (用Q矩阵左乘/右乘矩阵)

【签名】
```
ormqr_bufferSize<T>(
    handle, side, trans, m, n, k,
    A: const T*,       # Householder向量（来自geqrf）
    lda: int,
    tau: const T*,
    C: const T*,       # 输入矩阵
    ldc: int,
    lwork: int*
)

ormqr<T>(
    handle, side, trans, m, n, k,
    A: const T*, lda: int,
    tau: const T*,
    C: T*,             # 输出 Q*C 或 C*Q
    ldc: int,
    work: T*,
    lwork: int,
    devInfo: int*
)
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D|C|Z}ormqr(  # 复数类型用unmqr
    handle, side, trans, m, n, k,
    A, lda,
    tau,
    C, ldc,            # in-place更新
    work, lwork,
    devInfo
)
```

【备注】
- side: CUBLAS_SIDE_LEFT (Q*C) 或 RIGHT (C*Q)
- trans: CUBLAS_OP_N (Q), T (Q^T), C (Q^H)

