## syevd (对称/Hermitian矩阵特征值分解 - Divide & Conquer)

【签名】
```
syevd_bufferSize<T, Vtype>(
    handle, jobz, uplo, n,
    A: const T*,
    lda: int,
    W: const Vtype*,   # 特征值（实数）
    lwork: int*
) where (T, Vtype) in {(float, float), (double, double),
                       (complex<float>, float), (complex<double>, double)}

syevd<T, Vtype>(
    handle, jobz, uplo, n,
    A: T*,             # 输入矩阵，输出特征向量
    lda: int,
    W: Vtype*,         # 输出特征值
    work: T*,
    lwork: int,
    info: int*
)
```

【算法】
```
cusolverDn{S|D}syevd / cusolverDn{C|Z}heevd(
    handle, jobz, uplo, n,
    A, lda,            # in-place输出特征向量（列向量）
    W,                 # 输出 n 个特征值
    work, lwork,
    info
)
```

【备注】
- jobz: CUSOLVER_EIG_MODE_VECTOR (计算特征向量) 或 NOVECTOR
- 复数类型调用heevd（Hermitian）

